        "# Generic type\n",
        "\n",
        "A generic type is parameterized by one or more types, such as `list[int]`. Generic types are useful in annotations to describe containers and other reusable structures.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-generic-type)"
      ]
    }
